# Dependencies and build output are produced inside the image. Copying the host
# copies in would also drag Windows-resolved binaries (sharp, the swc native
# module) into a linux build.
node_modules
**/node_modules
.next
**/.next
.turbo
**/.turbo
dist
**/dist
out
**/out
coverage
**/coverage
*.tsbuildinfo
**/*.tsbuildinfo

.git
.gitignore
.github

# Deliberate: the image must take its NEXT_PUBLIC_* values from explicit build
# args, not from whichever .env.local happens to sit on the builder's disk.
# Leaving these out is what keeps `docker compose build` reproducible.
**/.env
**/.env.local
**/.env.*.local

# Test artefacts, never part of a runtime image.
**/test-results
**/playwright-report
**/.playwright

Dockerfile
.dockerignore
README.md
